        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 86184-221710, Modern Baden Barn Door Pull Set</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nHave no idea how to style your barn door in your midcentury modern space? Well, we've got you covered with Emtek's Baden Sliding Barn Door Set. It comes with everything you'll need to thru-bolt it on your sliding door including one door pull and a matching flush pull. This Baden Barn Door Pull Set is available in several stylish finishes including black, satin brass, and polished chrome. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nSee the Entire <a href=\"//search?type=product&q=baden\"><b>Emtek Baden Collection</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-86184-221710-installed.jpg?v=1704354515\" width=\"295\" height=\"291\" border=\"0\" align=\"right\" alt=\"Emtek 86184-221710 Installed\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Modern Baden Door Pull and Flush Pull Set:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Pull Total Length: 8-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Center to Center Length: 8\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Width: 1-1/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Total Projection: 2-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Base: 1\" x 1/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Flush Pull Overall Height: 10\"</li>\r\n<li>Flush Pull Overall Width: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Flush Pull Overall Depth: 3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Flush Pull Center to Center Height: 8\"</li>\r\n<li>Flush Pull Projection: 1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Flush Pull Cut-Out Height: 6-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Flush Pull Cut-Out Width: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Flush Pull Cup Height: 6-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Flush Pull Cup Width: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: for doors up to 1-3/4\" thick</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-86184-221710-specification.pdf?v=1704262375\"><b>Emtek 86184-221710 Dimensional Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-modern7-Finishes.jpg?v=1704354499\" width=\"599\" height=\"111\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
